		{"id":"e9e8a6dec19ed6fd","type":"text","text":"-  [Debug Menu](https://github.com/antzGames/Antz-Debug-Menu) v1.2\n- [Script IDE](https://github.com/Maran23/script-ide/releases/tag/2.2.3) v2.2.3\n- [Godot Resource Cleaner](https://github.com/ijoschek/GodotResourceCleaner/releases/tag/v0.7.1-beta) v0.7.1\n- [GDScript Formatter](https://github.com/GDQuest/GDScript-formatter/releases/tag/0.24.0) v0.24.0\n- [Project Time Tracker](https://github.com/Fifut/project-time-tracker/releases/tag/v2.0.8) v2.0.8\n\n### Priority 1 (setup)","x":-1110,"y":-1980,"width":250,"height":380},
