		{"id":"15efe38cbdf79801","type":"text","text":"UI ([CanvasLayer](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_canvaslayer.html))","x":-1600,"y":-800,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"de97347c9e6369af","type":"text","text":"player spawner ([Marker2d](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_marker2d.html#))","x":-1300,"y":-660,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f39054aedd76ad71","type":"text","text":"2 colors","x":260,"y":80,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ac2e0571fee6b610","type":"text","text":"music is now a full priority of mine (Chiel) i do need to wait for my recording equipment for now","x":320,"y":1236,"width":250,"height":142},
		{"id":"5e9a9f6059bef651","type":"text","text":"SFX have been made :D","x":240,"y":1480,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a9ee05636eeeda8d","type":"text","text":"color changes: we swapped from yellow to cream because cream looks better","x":970,"y":1236,"width":250,"height":93},
		{"id":"2477a844d771bb4c","type":"text","text":"HUD system for the collectables which appear somewhere on the screen","x":1170,"y":1043,"width":250,"height":97},
		{"id":"5278179e1edb40c1","type":"file","file":"static_files/Pasted image 20260803145020.png","x":1660,"y":1200,"width":399,"height":224},
		{"id":"86377ad71c5ae047","type":"text","text":"pretty rough comparison but those trees in that frame is what i mean","x":1735,"y":1053,"width":250,"height":87},
		{"id":"964ecdec71065c26","type":"text","text":"a little bit like this","x":1735,"y":1480,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7429c74f02c6d723","type":"text","text":"so we made some changes (yes it's more undertale)","x":695,"y":1041,"width":250,"height":98},
		{"id":"c0b63e4488030211","type":"text","text":"idea 2 is a luxury problem","x":280,"y":831,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cdbc8e6aba9adfe4","type":"text","text":"also we have found an artist thank you Erin for helping us","x":650,"y":761,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3a0d47221746bb4a","type":"text","text":"[https://erwall002.wixsite.com/erin-wall-1](https://erwall002.wixsite.com/erin-wall-1 \"https://erwall002.wixsite.com/erin-wall-1\")","x":720,"y":900,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"249c248b64496133","type":"file","file":"static_files/Pasted image 20260803145936.png","x":873,"y":1408,"width":194,"height":132},
		{"id":"71c8df779f9b24c6","type":"text","text":"new colors from our Erin the artist","x":1270,"y":1408,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"391a4ff715006a37","type":"text","text":"damaging system could be like undyne's chase where you only have environmental damage","x":500,"y":183,"width":250,"height":130},
		{"id":"643c2954c8cd41c5","type":"text","text":"i want to make the game based on the echo flower area in undertale","x":820,"y":183,"width":250,"height":88},
		{"id":"817888fee0127a79","type":"text","text":"Chiel's idea:\nopen world with if if we find a composer or if we are not capable of it ambient noises (no music, only sound effects). because i think the theme will be night i want to do it in white and a\nblue-ish black. my aim is to a zelda type game, otherwise a non combat open world (yume nikki(again), animal crossing, stardew valley, etc.).","x":1125,"y":-200,"width":250,"height":427},
		{"id":"f5554cd324f86f84","type":"text","text":"we are going to use a health system that works like a battery to use idea 2 to see more of the map and have a foresight of what to come, but the main way of sight is idea 1","x":1520,"y":28,"width":250,"height":218},
		{"id":"64b11204475f7efa","type":"text","text":"pls see this when you will read this [dean ideas](<dean ideas.md>)","x":695,"y":-153,"width":250,"height":74},
		{"id":"1102e720f1a93e84","type":"text","text":"AND YES, WE KNOW, THERE IS A LOT OF UNDERTALE BUT TOBY FOX WAS JUST THAT CREATIVE!!!!!!!","x":1720,"y":-191,"width":250,"height":150},
		{"id":"b40b4b5de5a86e87","type":"text","text":"the hotlands were also a cool thing to talk about to make a little platforming section in the game","x":1820,"y":183,"width":250,"height":126},
		{"id":"2b0871d69a4c06e3","type":"file","file":"static_files/Pasted image 20260731133401.png","x":1520,"y":418,"width":400,"height":298},
		{"id":"b2e7a3a34b859267","type":"text","text":"so we decided to execute the light source that we have to have nice sprites around the viewing area so that we can get some more style points","x":1170,"y":761,"width":250,"height":199},
		{"id":"4d310feb84232028","type":"file","file":"static_files/Pasted image 20260803144648.png","x":1660,"y":770,"width":400,"height":225}
	],
